情。", "content_rendered": "好多 V 友都做过针对 V 站优化，有做油猴脚本的，chrome 插件的，有做 APP 的，各式各样，光我见过的不下 10 个了，说明大家对这个有需求的。<br />既然有需求为何 V 站不自己去做呢？<br />实在搞不懂，让 AI 来一梭子分分钟的事情。", "last_modified": 1792937299, "replies": 24, "id": 1251696}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/70ef/df2e/17_large.png?m=1660301119", "name": "create", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/70ef/df2e/17_normal.png?m=1660301119", "title": "分享创造", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/create", "topics": 38162, "footer": "", "header": "欢迎你在这里发布自己的最新作品！", "title_alternative": "Create", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/70ef/df2e/17_mini.png?m=1660301119", "stars": 6246, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 17, "parent_node_name": "geek"}, "member": {"id": 82025, "username": "whoisharry", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/whoisharry", "website": null, "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": null, "tagline": null, "bio": null, "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9355/90f0/82025_mini.png?m=1784514405", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9355/90f0/82025_normal.png?m=1784514405", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9355/90f0/82025_large.png?m=1784514405", "avatar_xlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9355/90f0/82025_xlarge.png?m=1784514405", "avatar_xxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9355/90f0/82025_xxlarge.png?m=1784514405", "avatar_xxxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9355/90f0/82025_xxxlarge.png?m=1784514405", "created": 1416196154, "last_modified": 1784514405, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "cherishwinner334", "last_touched": 1792934268, "title": "搓了一个“V2EX 评论上下文”的 chrome 插件，方便 V 友阅读评论", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1251601", "created": 1792893543, "deleted": 0, "content": "![v2ex 评论区楼层引用信息自动展示插件]( https://www.mdview.cn/static/other/screenshot_marked.png)\r\n\r\n作用是，根据评论中的 #17 ，或者 @xxx ，或者“十七楼”，这样的信息，找到最近的一条回复，自动在当前这条评论上方展示。\r\n\r\n刚刚已上架到 chrome 应用商店，搜索 “V2EX 评论上下文” 即可。\r\n插件免费开源 [https://github.com/mdview2026/v2ex-comment-context]( https://github.com/mdview2026/v2ex-comment-context)\r\n\r\n解决了我自己遇到的一个痛点。如果对你也有用，就更好了。", "content_rendered": "<p><img alt=\"v2ex 评论区楼层引用信息自动展示插件\" class=\"embedded_image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://www.mdview.cn/static/other/screenshot_marked.png\"/></p>\n<p>作用是，根据评论中的 #17 ，或者 @<a href=\"/member/xxx\">xxx</a> ，或者“十七楼”，这样的信息，找到最近的一条回复，自动在当前这条评论上方展示。</p>\n<p>刚刚已上架到 chrome 应用商店，搜索 “V2EX 评论上下文” 即可。\n插件免费开源 <a href=\"https://github.com/mdview2026/v2ex-comment-context\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/mdview2026/v2ex-comment-context</a></p>\n<p>解决了我自己遇到的一个痛点。如果对你也有用，就更好了。</p>\n", "last_modified": 1792893543, "replies": 22, "id": 1251601}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/fd2c/5e46/1135_large.png?m=1751736785", "name": "openai", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/fd2c/5e46/1135_normal.png?m=1751736785", "title": "OpenAI", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/openai", "topics": 5039, "footer": "", "header": "关于 OpenAI 旗下产品 GPT，DALL·E，和 ChatGPT 的讨论。请不要在 V2EX 的回复中粘贴复制来自 AI 生成的文本。", "title_alternative": "OpenAI", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/fd2c/5e46/1135_mini.png?m=1751736785", "stars": 3418, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 1135, "parent_node_name": "geek"}, "member": {"id": 66852, "username": "break", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/break", "website": "http://www.shizuwu.cn", "twitter": "", "psn": "", "github": "", "btc": "", "location": "", "tagline": "", "bio": "", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/d64d/2297/66852_mini.png?m=1789095648", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/d64d/2297/66852_normal.png?m=1789095648", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/d64d/2297/66852_large.png?m=1789095648", "avatar_xlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/d64d/2297/66852_xlarge.png?m=1789095648", "avatar_xxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/d64d/2297/66852_xxlarge.png?m=1789095648", "avatar_xxxlarge": "https://c